    "title": "Israeli bulldozers continue razing agricultural land in Jenin-area village",
    "description": "JENIN: Israeli bulldozers continued on Sunday to raze agricultural land in the village of Zububa, west of Jenin, in the occupied West Bank. Local sources said Israeli bulldozers resumed work in the morning, clearing agricultural areas and uprooting olive trees, causing extensive damage to residents’ property and threatening the livelihoods of dozens of families.",
